<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"It's fine, looks like we shook him off."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We were hiding in the undergrowth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There were no streetlights at all, and the moonlight was hidden by the dense leaves of the trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The road beside us was so narrow that one car could only just get through.</STYLE><PG>
"Damn it, why won't you listen to me, Dad!
{PAUSE ""}
　Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> was shouting into her smartphone in a low voice, but there was still no response of any kind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Dammit, the charge is about to run out, too...
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, turn <STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE> smartphone on."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, a strong wind came raging through the whole area.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Look out!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MOTION "春花突き飛ばし" "人物1" "3" "960" "200" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\鉈峰うち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "-180" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n鉈振りおろし\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n480\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n鉈振りおろし\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n480\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "50"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "17!" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "escape2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The instant I shoved </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> out of the way, a </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="なた">nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> buried itself in that spot.</STYLE> [TN: a nata is a heavy single-edged Japanese billhook]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn! This way, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">We started running again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Running the mountain road was finally taking its toll.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, is this just plain exhaustion?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this is that...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"We're fine here. There's no way he can see us."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Stifling my ragged breath, I crouched down in the undergrowth again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The wind went on raging, and cherry blossoms were whirling down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that moment my intuition handed me a warning ― no, a verdict.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There is no way out. Escape is impossible, it said.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, footsteps from straight ahead―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's the shinigami...!</STYLE> [TN: shinigami: a god of death]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even though we were completely hidden,</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">it was heading straight for us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\死神近づく.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"What is that guy...! How does he know where we are!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">No matter where we hid, the shinigami pinpointed our location exactly and came after us immediately.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Once a curse has been placed on you, it will follow you anywhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is death, and that is the shinigami who rules over death.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that's wrong! That thing is just somebody in a disguise using some kind of trick!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Calling it a shinigami is a stretch at best!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And like this, in the past, six people...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And this time... even </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">my own dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>! Let's get to the wide road, quick! Hiding is no good!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> pulled me by the hand again and started running.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My legs were like lead by now, but I could not let myself stop here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I stopped moving, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> would be the shinigami's prey as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A moment ago the shinigami had tried to slash </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> open with the nata, after all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But this really was not simple fatigue after all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's right, I have a condition peculiar to this time of year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And it is starting up at the worst possible time.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―We ran down a narrow asphalt mountain road colored by a blizzard of cherry petals.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There still seemed to be a fair distance to go before the wide road.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, sorry...! Wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's wrong!? If you're tired, use my shoulder!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's part of it, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">at a time like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't tell me... the April sickness..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That distinctive dizziness and sense of collapse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Being fine all day today was the abnormal part.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sign of anything coming after us from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One side was a high rock face and the other a cliff, so there was no route for the shinigami to come by except from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The road was as narrow as ever, though...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道反転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, run for it alone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Are you an idiot! I told you I would protect <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> no matter what!
{PAUSE ""}
　Besides, Dad is after me too. Running for it alone changes nothing!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩くずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> put my arm around her shoulder and started walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> had to be quite tired herself.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, if the shinigami is carrying weapons, it must be badly worn out as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It probably cannot come after us quickly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... making trouble for you even at a time like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If it comes to that, this is all because I told you not to go to the police...
{PAUSE ""}
I'm the one who dragged you into this... no number of kowtows would ever make up for it..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... do you still think the curse is what made </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s dad appear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm not sure...
{PAUSE ""}
The truth is, I've started to think something is off.
{PAUSE ""}
I thought he came here to kill <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, but he is weirdly drawing it out ― he doesn't go straight for the kill.
{PAUSE ""}
And a minute ago he tried to cut me with the nata too.
{PAUSE ""}
If that is Dad... what is he thinking?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">With that monstrous strength and a way of pinning down our exact position, killing us would be no trouble at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why such a roundabout way? Is it enjoying the crime?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No. If I had not shoved </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> out of the way a moment ago, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> would have been killed.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, you were feeling fine all day, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that's not it, I'm not blaming you.
{PAUSE ""}
I've been thinking. Maybe cherry blossom isn't the only thing that sets off <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s April sickness attacks..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The weather today..."
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
"It's <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>Hello!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, are you alive!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Somehow... I'm not hurt, at least for now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s breathing had gotten very rough.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I ended up sinking down where I was.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We'll be there soon ourselves! It's... going to take another 40 minutes, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, but the local police should be there in about 10 minutes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"10 minutes, huh... But we keep going down the mountain and the mountain road never ends..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Go down the road along Sakuraoka Station about 2 kilometers and the road opens out all at once; there should be one convenience store there. Get inside it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
